# Docker build context for the images built from the repo root (bosn.toml:
# build-aux/appimage/Dockerfile and build-aux/appimage/manylinux/Dockerfile).
# Only what their COPY lines read: without this, Docker and bosn send the
# whole checkout (target/, .git, build trees, .deps/), and bosn refuses a
# context over 64 MiB ("manifest Dockerfile context was refused"). A new COPY
# from the repo root needs its file listed here.
# rust/tools/linux-validate/Dockerfile builds from its own directory instead.
*
!build-aux/appimage/Dockerfile
!build-aux/appimage/build.py
!build-aux/appimage/manylinux/Dockerfile
!build-aux/appimage/manylinux/deps.lock.json
!rust-toolchain.toml
!rust/tools/linux-validate/install_zccache.py
